# PROMPT — Recreate the "{{ brand_name }}" Hero Section Exactly

Build a pixel-exact, fully responsive landing page using HTML5, Tailwind CSS, and React.

## 1. PAGE ARCHITECTURE & VIEWPORT
{% if page_mode == 'fixed_single_screen' %}
- Section Constraint: `w-full h-screen overflow-hidden bg-['{{ bg_color }}']`
- Scroll Policy: Strictly single-viewport with NO vertical scrolling allowed (`overflow: hidden`).
{% else %}
- Section Constraint: `w-full min-h-screen bg-['{{ bg_color }}']`
- Scroll Policy: Multi-section landing page layout allowing smooth vertical scrolling.
{% endif %}

## 2. TYPOGRAPHY & DESIGN TOKENS
- Primary Font: '{{ font_family }}', sans-serif.
- Primary Accent Color: `{{ accent_color }}`
- Text Primary: `{{ text_primary }}`
- Text Secondary: `{{ text_secondary }}`
- Glassmorphic Elements: `background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter: blur({{ glass_blur }}); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);`
- Button Radius: `{{ button_radius }}`

## 3. LAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS & COPY
- Brand Name: "{{ brand_name }}"
{% if layout_type == 'center_stack' %}
- Layout Architecture: Centered Stack Column
- Container: Centered max-w-[800px] mx-auto, flex flex-col items-center text-center.
- H1 Headline: "{{ h1_text }}" (font-black, leading-[0.95], tracking-tight, color: {{ text_primary }}).
- Subhead: "{{ subhead_text }}" (color: {{ text_secondary }}, max-w-[480px], mt-6).
- Primary CTA: Button label "{{ primary_cta }}", rounded: {{ button_radius }}, px-8 py-3.5, background: {{ accent_color }}.
{% if secondary_cta %}
- Secondary CTA: Button label "{{ secondary_cta }}", rounded: {{ button_radius }}, px-8 py-3.5, border border-white/30.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
- Layout Architecture: Split Two-Column Grid
- Container: Two-column layout (max-w-[1400px] mx-auto, flex flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12).
- Left Column (50%): Text block containing H1 ("{{ h1_text }}"), Subhead ("{{ subhead_text }}"), and CTA ("{{ primary_cta }}").
- Right Column (50%): Interactive Showcase Container / Glassmorphic Card ({{ right_column_type }}).
{% endif %}

## 4. NAVIGATION SPECIFICATIONS
- Nav Style: {{ nav_style }}
- Nav Links: {{ nav_links }}
- Right Auth Button: "{{ nav_cta }}"

## 5. NON-NEGOTIABLE SPACING & PIXEL CONTRACTS
- Navigation: Height 52px, horizontal padding `px-6`, glassmorphic background with blur({{ glass_blur }}).
- CTA Buttons: MUST maintain explicit `px-8 py-3.5` padding. DO NOT allow button text to touch rounded boundaries.
- Animation Easing: `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` with `forwards` fill mode.
{% if page_mode == 'fixed_single_screen' %}
- Critical Rule: The page section MUST fit within 100vh. No layout shifts or outer scrollbars permitted.
{% endif %}